    <string name="permission_title">Permissions for audio capture</string>
    <string name="permission_text">Android requires the Microphone permission to capture audio from other apps. The microphone is not used: audio is not recorded and never leaves the phone — only volume levels and spectrum are sent to the network.\n\nThe notification shows the sync status and a Stop button.\n\nAndroid will then ask to allow screen recording — this is the system way to access audio. Choose \"Entire screen\".</string>


